  "a new dawn 花緑青が明ける日に|2025": {"id":1279865,"poster":"/wIXWBILvfweBOPfnOsaK71AFtXm.jpg","title":"花緑青が明ける日に","title_en":"A New Dawn","overview_en":"Keitaro lives in a fireworks factory that is about to be shut down. He is determined to unravel the mystery of the Shuhari, a mythical firework created by his father before he disappeared without a trace – and launch it before the factory closes.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[16,18],"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"imdb_id":"tt32192760","imdb_votes":42},
  "a new dawn|2025": {"id":1369678,"poster":"/1wclDMXv7uAmMcdp8dAkB5eaFIR.jpg","title":"Un Nuevo Amanecer","title_en":"A New Dawn","overview_en":"Due to a great coincidence of fate, I, a child then, did not go to a meeting with War. Other women did complete that meeting and joined the guerrilla. After many years this story comes back to me and, inevitably, I decided to go after it. How is it to be a guerrilla woman and lay down the weapons after the Peace Treaty?","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[99],"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"imdb_id":"tt36721291"},
  "a pale view of hills 遠い山なみの光|2025": {"id":1337985,"poster":"/eYlGoz58v1GIx8vlqcmQBhx4mxG.jpg","title":"遠い山なみの光","title_en":"A Pale View of Hills","overview_en":"Dual timelines explore a Japanese widow's memories spanning post-war Nagasaki in 1950s and England during 1980s Cold War era, unraveling secrets that intertwine her past and present experiences across borders.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[18,36],"vote_average":7.75,"vote_count":16,"imdb_id":"tt33253688","rt_critic":63,"rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/a_pale_view_of_hills","imdb_rating":6.7,"imdb_votes":414},
