  "arnie & barney – retten das wasser|*": null,
  "arnie & barney|*": {"id":1365598,"poster":"/9VTKxQqeUv7HAFrl1kPtPb0G8RZ.jpg","title":"Arnie & Barney – Retten das Wasser","title_en":"Arnie & Barney","overview":"Als eine Dürre ihre Wiese bedroht, machen sich die tollpatschigen Ameisen Arnie und Barney auf eine abenteuerliche Suche nach dem verschwundenen Wasser. Auf der Spur eines geheimen Wasserschmuggels stolpern sie durch aberwitzige Missgeschicke, doch mit der Unterstützung einer mysteriösen Superhelden-Mücke werden sie zu den ungewöhnlichsten Helden ihrer Welt.","overview_en":"A platoon of ants set out to save their community in the midst of a severe drought, but the hilariously inept Arnie and Barney – who are not cut out for heroics – decide to tackle the problem themselves. Their bumbling efforts lead them to uncover a shady water racket and team up with a secretive superhero mosquito. In a series of comical mishaps, they inadvertently save the meadow and become the most unlikely heroes of all.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[16,10751,14,12,35],"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"imdb_id":"tt38582706"},
  "aruku あるく|2025": null,
  "aruku|2025": {"id":1549923,"poster":"/or9FOyCajFxtUV5cv9lFNb1HeDl.jpg","title":"歩く","title_en":"Aruku","overview_en":"Thousands of travellers have visited Shikoku Island to complete the 88 Temple Pilgrimage. For more than nine centuries, they have walked a route of approximately 1200 kilometres following in the footsteps of the Buddhist monk Kukai.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[99],"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"imdb_id":"tt38590150"},
  "as young as you feel|*": {"id":451340,"poster":"/gnINwIWmM2qa4NpbagnDXDfmUk4.jpg","title":"Young as You Feel","title_en":"Young as You Feel","overview_en":"Father sells his drugstore and the Jones family heads for New York to enjoy sophisticated city life. They lose all their money before deciding to go back home.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[35],"vote_average":8,"vote_count":1,"imdb_id":"tt0033290","imdb_rating":8.4,"imdb_votes":36},
