  "chimney town: frozen in time 映画 えんとつ町のプペル ～約束の時計台～|2026": {"id":1464639,"poster":"/jjKlu7fAQrnVGaSnJ4Xzo8T4WCB.jpg","title":"映画 えんとつ町のプペル 〜約束の時計台〜","title_en":"Chimney Town: Frozen in Time","overview_en":"After losing his friend Poupelle, young Lubicchi wanders into a mysterious realm where a clock in a tower is frozen at 11:59. To return home, he must restart it – and find the courage to believe again.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[16,18,14,12],"vote_average":4.5,"vote_count":4,"imdb_id":"tt39371353","imdb_votes":7},
