  "crazy mama|*": {"id":89602,"poster":"/868gQ8gYhBggAy3meIx57fUfsDY.jpg","title":"Verrückte Mama","title_en":"Crazy Mama","overview":"Auf der Flucht vor ihren Gläubigern und dem Gesetz begibt sich die resolute Melba (Cloris Leachman) gemeinsam mit ihrer Mutter (Ann Sothern), ihren schwangeren Tochter (Linda Purl) und ihrem zukünftigem Schwiegersohn (Don Most) auf einen wilden Trip von Kalifornien nach Arkansas...","overview_en":"Melba Stokes, her mother Sheba and daughter Cheryl embark on a crime spree after their California beauty parlor is repossessed. Their destination is Arkansas, where the three generations of women want to reclaim the family farm.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[80,28,35],"vote_average":5.563,"vote_count":24,"imdb_id":"tt0072829","rt_critic":92,"rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/crazy_mama/","imdb_rating":5.4,"imdb_votes":1091},
