  "gewalt und leidenschaft|*": {"id":56142,"poster":"/r7Dhjs8xbCCjOY2X9xu3eQpPVes.jpg","title":"Gewalt und Leidenschaft","title_en":"Conversation Piece","overview":"Der Alltag eines gemütlichen Professors  wird von seinen neuen Mietern gehörig aufgemischt. Die Lebenslust seiner Untermieter sorgt für reichlich Turbulenzen. Zunächst ist der Professor eher genervt, doch nach und nach lässt er sich von ihrem Lebenshunger anstecken...","overview_en":"A retired professor of American origin lives a solitary life in a luxurious palazzo in Rome. He is confronted by a vulgar Italian marchesa and her lover, her daughter and her daughter's boyfriend, and forced to rent to them an apartment on the upper floor of his palazzo. From this point on his quiet routine is turned into chaos by his tenants' machinations, and everybody's life takes an unexpected but inevitable turn.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[18,10749],"vote_average":7.331,"vote_count":163,"imdb_id":"tt0071585","rt_critic":83,"rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/conversation_piece/","imdb_rating":7.4,"imdb_votes":5395},
  "gharibeh va meh|1974": {"id":266230,"poster":"/gbAGEotQ4TA2VKxbQuOP8pR6GzC.jpg","title":"غریبه و مه","title_en":"The Stranger and the Fog","overview_en":"In a remote seaside village, the peaceful lives of the residents are upended when they spot a mysterious boat drifting toward the shore. Upon pulling it in, they find a weary and wounded stranger named Ayat, who has no memory of how he got there. He only recalls being attacked and barely escaping with his life. As Ayat tries to rebuild his sense of self and uncover the truth about his past, he becomes a source of curiosity and suspicion in the community.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[18,9648],"vote_average":7.8,"vote_count":4,"imdb_id":"tt0071549","imdb_rating":7.2,"imdb_votes":283},
