  "komm tanz mit mir|*": {"id":1025015,"poster":null,"title":"Komm tanz mit mir","title_en":"Komm tanz mit mir","overview_en":"Documentary about the dancer and choreographer Trudi Schoop and her work with people with mental illness through her dance therapy.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[99],"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},
  "kommunist|*": {"id":1638402,"poster":"/pSOGn8Nam6T4WcoBci7zbtRzIgu.jpg","title":"Kommunist","title_en":"Kommunist","overview":"Als Kronprinz von Erich Honecker machte Egon Krenz SED-Karriere, am Ende war er der letzte Staatschef der DDR. Doch er führte das Land nur 50 Tage, nach der Wiedervereinigung wurde er wegen seiner Mitverantwortung für die Mauertoten zu sechseinhalb Jahren Haft verurteilt. Seit seiner Entlassung 2003 lebt er in Dierhagen an der Ostsee.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[99,36],"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"overview_en":"As Erich Honecker’s “crown prince,” Egon Krenz rose through the ranks of the SED; in the end, he became the last head of state of the GDR. However, he led the country for only 50 days; after reunification, he was sentenced to six and a half years in prison for his shared responsibility for the deaths of those who died trying to cross the Berlin Wall. Since his release in 2003, he has lived in Dierhagen on the Baltic Sea."},
  "kommunist|2003": {"id":1638402,"poster":"/pSOGn8Nam6T4WcoBci7zbtRzIgu.jpg","title":"Kommunist","title_en":"Kommunist","overview":"Als Kronprinz von Erich Honecker machte Egon Krenz SED-Karriere, am Ende war er der letzte Staatschef der DDR. Doch er führte das Land nur 50 Tage, nach der Wiedervereinigung wurde er wegen seiner Mitverantwortung für die Mauertoten zu sechseinhalb Jahren Haft verurteilt. Seit seiner Entlassung 2003 lebt er in Dierhagen an der Ostsee.","overview_en":"As Erich Honecker’s “crown prince,” Egon Krenz rose through the ranks of the SED; in the end, he became the last head of state of the GDR. However, he led the country for only 50 days; after reunification, he was sentenced to six and a half years in prison for his shared responsibility for the deaths of those who died trying to cross the Berlin Wall. Since his release in 2003, he has lived in Dierhagen on the Baltic Sea.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[99,36],"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},
  "konklave / conclave|*": {"id":1602673,"poster":"/r8WTDEsGvZ4551eA6OFOobUUi8.jpg","title":"Secrets of the Conclave","title_en":"Secrets of the Conclave","overview_en":"Following the death of Pope Francis, 135 cardinals enter the Vatican in total secrecy to pray, maneuver, and vote among themselves as both electors and candidates in an ancient ritual that determines the future of the Catholic Church.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[99],"vote_average":8.5,"vote_count":2,"imdb_id":"tt39091265","imdb_rating":7.2,"imdb_votes":37},
