  "kōkaku kidōtai/ghost in the shell|*": {"id":1104401,"poster":"/jO7BY7hQq5Re7rX8nEgev5PmJI9.jpg","title":"攻殻機動隊 SAC_2045 最後の人間","title_en":"Ghost in the Shell: SAC_2045 The Last Human","overview_en":"In 2045, amidst an economic disaster and the rapid evolution of AI in a world where sustainable warfare is on the rise, Public Security Section 9, led by Motoko Kusanagi, arrives in Tokyo to confront the \"post-human\" Takashi Shimamura and prevent the looming threat of nuclear war. A compilation film with newly added footage.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[16,28,878],"vote_average":6.9,"vote_count":10,"imdb_id":"tt32339908","rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/ghost_in_the_shell_sac_2045_the_last_human","imdb_votes":10},
  "l'armée des ombres|1942": {"id":15383,"poster":"/rtZQCFsWVPt4i9BjBxVSCqB2ynf.jpg","title":"Armee im Schatten","title_en":"Army of Shadows","overview":"Im Frankreich des Jahres 1942 bekämpfen die Mitglieder der Résistance die Nazi-Besatzer.Philippe Gerbier, Mitglied des Widerstands, konnte mit Mühe aus der Nazi- Haft entkommen und versucht nun, den Mann zu finden und zu richten, der Schuld an seiner Verhaftung ist. Mathilde, die Mitglied und Leiterin der Pariser Résistance ist, soll von der Gestapo gezwungen werden, den Widerstand zu verraten, wenn sie ihre Tochter wiedersehen will...","overview_en":"Betrayed by an informant, Philippe Gerbier finds himself trapped in a torturous Nazi prison camp. Though Gerbier escapes to rejoin the Resistance in occupied Marseilles, France, and exacts his revenge on the informant, he must continue a quiet, seemingly endless battle against the Nazis in an atmosphere of tension, paranoia and distrust.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[10752,18,53,36],"vote_average":7.892,"vote_count":752,"imdb_id":"tt0064040","rt_critic":97,"rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/army-of-shadows-1969/","imdb_rating":8.1,"imdb_votes":27228},
