  "maciste, l’uomo più forte del mondo|*": {"id":103026,"poster":"/pSUmy77xcJPH6JKI6kmBcAX8zzR.jpg","title":"Maciste und die Königin der Nacht","title_en":"Mole Men Against the Son of Hercules","overview":"Maciste wird Zeuge, wie die Flüchtigen eines Dorfes von bösen Maulwurfmenschen niedergemetzelt werden. Er findet die übrigen Dorfbewohner ebenfalls weitgehend tot vor und beschließt, sie zu rächen. Dabei befreit er den Sklaven Bango aus der Gefangenschaft der Unterirdischen und lässt sich gemeinsam mit diesem in das unterirdische Reich der Maulwurfmenschen verschleppen, wo unzählige Sklaven für die Königin der Macht Diamanten abbauen müssen...","overview_en":"Maciste arranges for himself and his new friend Bangor to be captured by a mysterious band of white-clad marauders and taken to an underground city. There the two are forced to turn an enormous wheel along with other captives as part of a gold-and-diamonds mining operation. The underground city's queen, Halis Mosab, takes note of the handsome, muscular Maciste and chooses him to be her consort if he can meet such challenges as saving the kidnapped Princess Saliura from a gigantic ape. Maciste kills the ape and carries Saliura back to the aboveground world. The white-clad marauders can't follow them if it means being caught in the sunlight which instantly dissolves them. Maciste then returns to the underground city to save the other captives. Meanwhile, high priest Kahab informs his son, Katar, that their queen is not one of them but, unbeknownst to her, was kidnapped as a small child from the \"world above.\" If Katar can marry her...","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[12,14,10749],"vote_average":5.5,"vote_count":11,"imdb_id":"tt0055117","rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/hercules-mole-men-against-the-son-of-hercules/","imdb_rating":4.8,"imdb_votes":382},
  "maciste, l’uomo più forte del mondo|1961": {"id":103026,"poster":"/pSUmy77xcJPH6JKI6kmBcAX8zzR.jpg","title":"Maciste und die Königin der Nacht","title_en":"Mole Men Against the Son of Hercules","overview":"Maciste wird Zeuge, wie die Flüchtigen eines Dorfes von bösen Maulwurfmenschen niedergemetzelt werden. Er findet die übrigen Dorfbewohner ebenfalls weitgehend tot vor und beschließt, sie zu rächen. Dabei befreit er den Sklaven Bango aus der Gefangenschaft der Unterirdischen und lässt sich gemeinsam mit diesem in das unterirdische Reich der Maulwurfmenschen verschleppen, wo unzählige Sklaven für die Königin der Macht Diamanten abbauen müssen...","overview_en":"Maciste arranges for himself and his new friend Bangor to be captured by a mysterious band of white-clad marauders and taken to an underground city. There the two are forced to turn an enormous wheel along with other captives as part of a gold-and-diamonds mining operation. The underground city's queen, Halis Mosab, takes note of the handsome, muscular Maciste and chooses him to be her consort if he can meet such challenges as saving the kidnapped Princess Saliura from a gigantic ape. Maciste kills the ape and carries Saliura back to the aboveground world. The white-clad marauders can't follow them if it means being caught in the sunlight which instantly dissolves them. Maciste then returns to the underground city to save the other captives. Meanwhile, high priest Kahab informs his son, Katar, that their queen is not one of them but, unbeknownst to her, was kidnapped as a small child from the \"world above.\" If Katar can marry her...","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[12,14,10749],"vote_average":5.5,"vote_count":11,"imdb_id":"tt0055117","rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/hercules-mole-men-against-the-son-of-hercules/","imdb_rating":4.8,"imdb_votes":382},
  "mag mag|2025": {"id":1492608,"poster":"/gzkn4qkCFXE4GJ0aJNdGVI97kbs.jpg","title":"John Candy: Ich mag mich","title_en":"John Candy: I Like Me","overview":"Die, die John Candy am besten kannten, teilen seine Geschichte, in ihren eigenen Worten, mithilfe von nie gesehenem Archivmaterial, Fotos und Interviews. Es ist eine Dokumentation über das Leben, die Karriere und den Verlust eines der beliebtesten Comedy-Schauspieler aller Zeiten.","overview_en":"Those who knew iconic funnyman John Candy best share his story, in their own words, through never-before-seen archival footage, imagery, and interviews.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[99],"vote_average":7.8,"vote_count":97,"imdb_id":"tt26683420","rt_critic":89,"rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/john_candy_i_like_me","imdb_rating":8,"imdb_votes":11114},
