  "marte um - mars one|*": {"id":913816,"poster":"/nBp6ekvZHV8oSQu8gpzj6ncM3L2.jpg","title":"Marte Um","title_en":"Mars One","overview_en":"A middle-class Black family in Brazil copes with the election of a far-right extremist president. The mother believes that she's cursed after an unexpected encounter, while her husband puts all of his hopes into their son's soccer career.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[18],"vote_average":7.366,"vote_count":97,"imdb_id":"tt16377816","rt_critic":97,"rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/mars_one","imdb_rating":7.4,"imdb_votes":2410},
  "marty supreme|*": {"id":1317288,"poster":"/m3Sj2vnS9o1wcHG1fCpUIhz0Y7e.jpg","title":"Marty Supreme","title_en":"Marty Supreme","overview":"Schuhverkäufer Marty hat nur ein Ziel: Weltmeister im Tischtennis zu werden und somit in den Olymp der gefeierten Athleten aufzusteigen, zu denen er sich selbst schon lange zählt. Um an einem Turnier in London teilnehmen zu können, riskiert er alles.","overview_en":"Marty Mauser, a young man with a dream no one respects, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[18,53],"vote_average":7.4,"vote_count":1816,"imdb_id":"tt32916440","rt_critic":93,"rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/marty_supreme","imdb_rating":7.7,"imdb_votes":164546},
  "mary & max - oder schrumpfen schafe wenn es regnet?|2009": {"id":24238,"poster":"/yYmjG19JbLcO2RE2ZXPaYlFaGC5.jpg","title":"Mary & Max - oder: Schrumpfen Schafe, wenn es regnet?","title_en":"Mary and Max","overview":"Eine liebenswerte Geschichte über die Beziehung zweier ungleicher Außenseiter, gespickt mit feinem schwarzen Humor. Die kleine Mary, gestraft mit einem \"kackafarbenen\" Muttermal auf der Stirn, lebt ohne Freunde in Australien. Also beschließt sie, mit dem zufällig aus einem Telefonbuch ausgewählten Max aus New York eine Brieffreundschaft zu beginnen, was dessen geordnete Welt gehörig aus den Angeln hebt.","overview_en":"A tale of friendship between two unlikely pen pals: Mary, a lonely, eight-year-old girl living in the suburbs of Melbourne, and Max, a forty-four-year old, severely obese man living in New York.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[16,35,18],"vote_average":7.879,"vote_count":2289,"imdb_id":"tt0978762","rt_critic":96,"rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/1209767-mary_and_max/","imdb_rating":8.1,"imdb_votes":199582},
  "mary shelley's frankenstein|*": {"id":3036,"poster":"/bOwCAQsZlEKrwhPi1ejY6BS8jpL.jpg","title":"Mary Shelleys Frankenstein","title_en":"Mary Shelley's Frankenstein","overview":"Victor Frankenstein ist nicht verrückt – er ist besessen! Über seinen Freund Henry lernt er den obskuren Professor Waldman kennen. Seitdem treibt Frankenstein nur noch eins: die Idee von der Erschaffung des künstlichen Menschen. Eines Nachts glückt das Experiment.","overview_en":"Victor Frankenstein is a promising young doctor who, devastated by the death of his mother during childbirth, becomes obsessed with bringing the dead back to life. His experiments lead to the creation of a monster, which Frankenstein has put together with the remains of corpses. It's not long before Frankenstein regrets his actions.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[18,27,878,10749],"vote_average":6.446,"vote_count":1372,"imdb_id":"tt0109836","rt_critic":42,"rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/mary_shelleys_frankenstein/","imdb_rating":6.3,"imdb_votes":63458},
  "maspalomas|*": {"id":1400214,"poster":"/sP9OGr40uSnB8oJB8a6aHzVL6Ez.jpg","title":"Maspalomas","title_en":"Maspalomas","overview":"Sommersonne, Strand und Partys: 25 Jahre nach seinem späten Outing genießt der 76-jährige Vicente sein Leben als offen schwuler Mann auf Gran Canaria. Doch ein plötzlicher Schlaganfall verändert alles: Seine Tochter holt ihn nach San Sebastián zurück, er landet in einem Pflegeheim und muss einmal mehr ein neues Leben beginnen. Denn um Problemen aus dem Weg zu gehen, verheimlicht er nun wieder seine Sexualität und wird zu dem traurigen alten Mann, der er nie sein wollte. Bis ihm sein neuer Mitbewohner klarmacht, dass er sich damit nicht abfinden darf.","overview_en":"After breaking up with his partner, 76 year-old Vicente leads life the way he likes it in Maspalomas: he spends his days lying in the sun, partying, and looking for pleasure. An unexpected accident obliges him to return to San Sebastián and to the daughter he abandoned years ago. Vicente will have to live in a retirement home where he finds himself driven back into the closet and to conceal a part of himself that he thought was long resolved. In this new environment, Vicente must ask himself if he has enough time left to make his peace with others… and with himself.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[18],"vote_average":6.714,"vote_count":56,"imdb_id":"tt34945265","rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/maspalomas","imdb_rating":7.2,"imdb_votes":1378},
  "masters of the universe|*": {"id":454639,"poster":"/c4hwwylwgo5lBO2O2WSBxxQF2kC.jpg","title":"Masters of the Universe","title_en":"Masters of the Universe","overview":"Nach 15 Jahren der Trennung führt das Schwert der Macht Prinz Adam zurück nach Eternia und entdeckt, dass seine Heimat unter der heimtückischen Herrschaft von Skeletor in Trümmern liegt. Um seine Familie und seine Welt zu retten, muss sich Adam mit seinen engsten Verbündeten zusammenschließen – Teela und Duncan alias Man-At-Arms – und sein wahres Schicksal als He-Man annehmen, den mächtigsten Mann des Universums.","overview_en":"After being separated for 15 years, the Sword of Power leads Prince Adam back to Eternia, where he discovers his home shattered under the fiendish rule of Skeletor. To save his family and his world, Adam must join forces with his closest allies, Teela and Duncan/Man-At-Arms, and embrace his true destiny as He-Man — the most powerful man in the universe.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[28,14,878],"vote_average":7.311,"vote_count":206,"imdb_id":"tt0427340","imdb_rating":6.9,"imdb_votes":37893},
  "masters of the universe|2026": {"id":454639,"poster":"/5Fx6uduswU2Z5UplnjLr4iu9URi.jpg","title":"Masters of the Universe","title_en":"Masters of the Universe","overview":"Nach 15 Jahren der Trennung führt das Schwert der Macht Prinz Adam zurück nach Eternia und entdeckt, dass seine Heimat unter der heimtückischen Herrschaft von Skeletor in Trümmern liegt. Um seine Familie und seine Welt zu retten, muss sich Adam mit seinen engsten Verbündeten zusammenschließen – Teela und Duncan alias Man-At-Arms – und sein wahres Schicksal als He-Man annehmen, den mächtigsten Mann des Universums.","overview_en":"After being separated for 15 years, the Sword of Power leads Prince Adam back to Eternia, where he discovers his home shattered under the fiendish rule of Skeletor. To save his family and his world, Adam must join forces with his closest allies, Teela and Duncan/Man-At-Arms, and embrace his true destiny as He-Man — the most powerful man in the universe.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[28,14,878],"vote_average":9.2,"vote_count":5,"imdb_id":"tt0427340","imdb_rating":6.9,"imdb_votes":37893},
  "mater/outcast days|*": null,
  "materia prima|2026": {"id":1635401,"poster":"/70eeeLn5qExH8JEzC1AwnnE4RWV.jpg","title":"Materia Prima","title_en":"Materia Prima","overview_en":"The Bolivian Andes are rich in both lithium and drama in a film about a new gold rush, where global interests collide and 500 years of colonial history continue to haunt the present.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[99],"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},
