  "obsession - du sollst mich lieben / obsession|*": {"id":1339713,"poster":"/un8N0wc1CvQETjztHazp5peCBlz.jpg","title":"Obsession - Du sollst mich lieben","title_en":"Obsession","overview":"Als der hoffnungslose Romantiker Bear einen magischen Gegenstand nutzt, damit sein Crush endlich Gefühle für ihn entwickelt, muss er feststellen, dass manche Wünsche einen finsteren, unheimlichen Tribut fordern.","overview_en":"After breaking the mysterious \"One Wish Willow\" to win his crush's heart, a hopeless romantic finds himself getting exactly what he asked for but soon discovers that some desires come at a dark, sinister price.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[27,53],"vote_average":7.904,"vote_count":940,"imdb_id":"tt37287335","rt_critic":94,"rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/obsession_2025","imdb_rating":8.2,"imdb_votes":50183},
