  "shatranj-e baad|1976": {"id":194088,"poster":"/qWbv6gh4afuViD5QInuNRNWZDCD.jpg","title":"شطرنج باد","title_en":"Chess of the Wind","overview_en":"The first lady of a noble house has died and now there is conflict between the remainders for taking over her heritage.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[18,9648,53],"vote_average":7.108,"vote_count":37,"imdb_id":"tt0318069","rt_critic":100,"rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/chess_of_the_wind","imdb_rating":7.3,"imdb_votes":1862},
  "shaun das schaf - spuk im kürbisfeld|*": {"id":1477104,"poster":"/mMOptSPBVGUA9GHgnpsC35GzZ7e.jpg","title":"Shaun das Schaf - Spuk im Kürbisfeld","title_en":"Shaun the Sheep: The Beast of Mossy Bottom","overview":"Die Bewohner der Mossy Bottom Farm freuen sich auf Halloween - bis der tollpatschige Farmer das geliebte Kürbisfeld der Herde verwüstet! Als Shaun zum verrückten Wissenschaftler wird, um das Problem zu lösen, geraten die Dinge schnell außer Kontrolle. Der Farmer ist verschwunden und ein wildes Biest treibt sein Unwesen in den Wäldern von Mossingham - alle Zutaten für ein monströses Familienabenteuer sind vorhanden.","overview_en":"On Halloween Eve at Mossy Bottom Farm, excitement turns to dismay when the clumsy Farmer ruins the pumpkin patch. Shaun tries fixing it with science experiments, but things go wrong when a wild beast appears in the woods.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[16,35,12,878,10751],"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"imdb_id":"tt36841161"},
