  "spotlight - sneak preview|*": {"id":1220030,"poster":"/3XARNEq4obOjM7Xy6CpAcoyCiEC.jpg","title":"All In Sneak Preview","title_en":"All In Sneak Preview","overview_en":"Cheng Jialang and Wei Yifu are the contemporary poker twin stars, and they are about to have their first face-to-face confrontation. However, at this moment, Cheng Jialang accidentally transferred his poker talent to a small-time crook named Huang Xiaoqi, who had no previous experience. The two of them went through a wonderful journey and decided to join forces to challenge Wei Yifu.","kind":"movie","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},
