  "taunus filmfest 2026: maricel|2025": {"id":1569803,"poster":"/5T9h5pGOHORAC3PKXGqf60Gec9G.jpg","title":"Maricel","title_en":"Maricel","overview_en":"A Filipino domestic worker is called to take care of an elderly couple in a Cypriot mountain village. What begins as a simple caregiving task gradually exposes a web of silent resentment, emotional dependency and unspoken histories, forcing her into the delicate, unsettling space between obligation and intimacy.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[18],"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"imdb_id":"tt38784338","imdb_rating":7.8,"imdb_votes":12},
  "taunus filmfest 2026: neun|2025": {"id":1423993,"poster":"/pnavZe5drsTQmLTSum4kXMUYukj.jpg","title":"Neun Tage Im August","title_en":"Nine Days in August","overview_en":"From the outside, 18-year-old Lea seems to have it all together: she’s finished school, spends time with friends, and stays active. Her father sees no reason to worry. But Lea is pregnant. As carefree summer days slip by—filled with swimming, parties, and sunrises—she navigates the bureaucracy of getting an abortion","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[18],"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},
  "taunus filmfest 2026: run|2025": {"id":7443,"poster":"/tacapm6j3danmLSXNJDtLNB8SBn.jpg","title":"Chicken Run - Hennen rennen","title_en":"Chicken Run","overview":"Auf Mr. und Mrs. Tweedys düsterer Geflügelfarm herrscht das hühnerverachtende Motto: Wer nichts zum Frühstück beiträgt, endet als Abendessen! Kein Wunder, dass die rebellische Jung-Henne Ginger dieser Hühnerhölle schnellstmöglich entkommen will. Zusammen mit ihren Leidensgenossinnen, der Rekord-Eierlegerin Bunty, der etwas unterbelichteten Babs, dem holländischen Technik-Genie Mac und dem greisen Hahn Fowler, plant sie die Flucht. Doch bisher wurde jeder Ausbruchversuch von der bösartigen Mrs. Tweedy, ihrem tumben Mann oder den gemeingefährlichen Hofhunden vereitelt. Erst als der amerikanische Zirkus-Gockel Rocky unvermittelt im wahrsten Sinne des Wortes auf dem Hühnerhof landet, reift in Ginger ein genialer Plan: Die Geflügel-Gemeinschaft muss einfach davonfliegen, und Flughahn Rocky soll den anderen das Fliegen beibringen!","overview_en":"The creators of Wallace & Gromit bring you an exciting and original story about a group of chickens determined to fly the coop–even if they can’t fly! It’s hardly poultry in motion when Rocky attempts to teach Ginger and her feathered friends to fly…but, with teamwork, determination and a little bit o’ cluck, the fearless flock plots one last attempt in a spectacular bid for freedom.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[16,35,10751],"vote_average":6.848,"vote_count":5450,"imdb_id":"tt0120630","rt_critic":97,"rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/chicken_run/","imdb_rating":7.1,"imdb_votes":223786},
