  "terminator|*": {"id":218,"poster":"/kdYu7YJJP0uuGEuhUX5toqvBSog.jpg","title":"Terminator","title_en":"The Terminator","overview":"Ein Cyborg aus der Zukunft wird auf eine tödliche Mission in die heutige Gegenwart geschickt. Er soll Sarah Connor töten, eine junge Frau, die eine entscheidende Rolle für die Zukunft der Menschheit spielen wird. Sie hat nur eine Chance, Kyle Reese, ein Freiheitskämpfer, der ebenfalls aus der Zukunft kommt.","overview_en":"In the post-apocalyptic future, reigning tyrannical supercomputers teleport a cyborg assassin known as the \"Terminator\" back to 1984 to kill Sarah Connor, whose unborn son is destined to lead insurgents against 21st century mechanical hegemony. Meanwhile, the human-resistance movement dispatches a lone warrior to safeguard Sarah. Can he stop the virtually indestructible killing machine?","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[28,53,878],"vote_average":7.684,"vote_count":14651,"imdb_id":"tt0088247","rt_critic":90,"rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/terminator/","imdb_rating":8.1,"imdb_votes":996325},
  "terror! il castello delle donne maledette|*": {"id":3159,"poster":"/yeVaRA8d3bNVDYHgaMhod9obACS.jpg","title":"Die Leichenfabrik des Dr. Frankenstein","title_en":"Frankenstein's Castle of Freaks","overview":"Der wahnsinnige Graf Frankenstein hält in seinem Schloss einen Urmenschen gefangen, dem er ein neues Hirn einpflanzt","overview_en":"Mad Dr Frankenstein recruits an evil dwarf, a Neanderthal man, and others to help him put a brain in the body of a brute.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[27],"vote_average":4.316,"vote_count":38,"imdb_id":"tt0069851","rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/frankensteins_castle_of_freaks/","imdb_rating":3.8,"imdb_votes":1280},
