  "toshkua|*": {"id":1129935,"poster":"/vzMXQHhDY67QadjAthiBbCKcmmr.jpg","title":"Toshkua","title_en":"Disappear","overview_en":"Mary travels from Honduras to the United States looking for her son, a migrant kidnapped in Mexico. Francisco, the dean of the Pesh community, fights against the extinction of the tropical forest. Both struggle against disappearance.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[99],"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},
  "toxic|2026": {"id":338969,"poster":"/kHM56ZLoSkNJnvmE68q7tOlopkP.jpg","title":"The Toxic Avenger","title_en":"The Toxic Avenger Unrated","overview":"Infolge eines katastrophalen Giftunfalls mit radioaktivem Müll verwandelt sich der zum Fußabtreter degradierte Hausmeister Winston Gooze in eine neue Art von Held: The Toxic Avenger. Als Rächer der Schutzlosen nimmt er den Kampf gegen Korruption und skrupellose Konzernbosse wie seinen einstigen Chef Bob Garbinger auf. In einer Welt, in der Gier grassiert, wird Gerechtigkeit am besten radioaktiv serviert!","overview_en":"When a downtrodden janitor, Winston Gooze, is exposed to a catastrophic toxic accident, he’s transformed into a new kind of hero: The Toxic Avenger. Now, Toxie must rise from outcast to savior, taking on ruthless corporate overlords and corrupt forces who threaten his son, his friends, and his community.","kind":"movie","genre_ids":[28,35,878],"vote_average":5.939,"vote_count":424,"imdb_id":"tt1633359","rt_critic":86,"rt_url":"https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/the_toxic_avenger_2023","imdb_rating":5.9,"imdb_votes":17723},
